#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:914
msgid "<0-32> In multi-monitor configurations (i.e. a single desktop that spans across multiple displays), this option tells mpv which screen to display the video on."
msgstr "<0-32> In multi-monitor configurations (i.e. a single desktop that spans across multiple displays), this option tells mpv which screen to display the video on."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:780
msgid "<0-5> Set the filter applied prior to PNG compression. 0 is none, 1 is 'sub', 2 is 'up', 3 is 'average', 4 is 'Paeth', and 5 is 'mixed'. This affects the level of compression that can be achieved. For most images, 'mixed' achieves the best compression ratio, hence it is the default."
msgstr "<0-5> Set the filter applied prior to PNG compression. 0 is none, 1 is 'sub', 2 is 'up', 3 is 'average', 4 is 'Paeth', and 5 is 'mixed'. This affects the level of compression that can be achieved. For most images, 'mixed' achieves the best compression ratio, hence it is the default."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:775
msgid "<0-9> Set the PNG compression level. Higher means better compression. This will affect the file size of the written screenshot file and the time it takes to write a screenshot. Too high compression might occupy enough CPU time to interrupt playback. The default is 7."
msgstr "<0-9> Set the PNG compression level. Higher means better compression. This will affect the file size of the written screenshot file and the time it takes to write a screenshot. Too high compression might occupy enough CPU time to interrupt playback. The default is 7."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:543
msgid "<0..1024> Gamut mapping 3DLUT size. Setting a dimension to 0 picks the default value. Defaults to 256."
msgstr "<0..1024> Gamut mapping 3DLUT size. Setting a dimension to 0 picks the default value. Defaults to 256."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:538
msgid "<0..1024> Gamut mapping 3DLUT size. Setting a dimension to 0 picks the default value. Defaults to 32."
msgstr "<0..1024> Gamut mapping 3DLUT size. Setting a dimension to 0 picks the default value. Defaults to 32."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:533
msgid "<0..1024> Gamut mapping 3DLUT size. Setting a dimension to 0 picks the default value. Defaults to 48."
msgstr "<0..1024> Gamut mapping 3DLUT size. Setting a dimension to 0 picks the default value. Defaults to 48."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:330
msgid "<0..16> The number of debanding steps to perform per sample. Each step reduces a bit more banding, but takes time to compute. Note that the strength of each step falls off very quickly, so high numbers (>4) are practically useless. Defaults to 1."
msgstr "<0..16> The number of debanding steps to perform per sample. Each step reduces a bit more banding, but takes time to compute. Note that the strength of each step falls off very quickly, so high numbers (>4) are practically useless. Defaults to 1."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:656
msgid "<0..4096> Tone mapping LUT size. Setting 0 picks the default size. Defaults to 256."
msgstr "<0..4096> Tone mapping LUT size. Setting 0 picks the default size. Defaults to 256."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:587
msgid "<0.0..0.5> Configures the knee point minimum as a percentage of the PQ luminance range. Provides a hard limit on the knee point chosen by knee_adaptation. Defaults to 0.1."
msgstr "<0.0..0.5> Configures the knee point minimum as a percentage of the PQ luminance range. Provides a hard limit on the knee point chosen by knee_adaptation. Defaults to 0.1."

#: C:\Users\Wanderson\OneDrive\Documentos\MeusProjetos\WandersondeSouza\mpv.net\src\MpvNet.Windows\Resources\editor_conf.txt:508
